                                <p class="text-sm text-slate-800 dark:text-slate-200 font-medium">Yangi foydalanuvchi ro'yxatdan o'tdi</p>
                                <p class="text-xs text-slate-400">malika.design@gmail.com</p>
                                <span class="text-[10px] text-slate-400 font-medium">3 soat oldin</span>
